flowchart TD
    A[Input: Multiple Website URLs] --> B[Job Manager]

    B --> C[Domain Normalizer]
    C --> D[Site Profile Builder]

    D --> E[Robots.txt + Sitemap + RSS Checker]
    E --> F[Permission + Scope Checker]

    F --> G{Allowed?}
    G -- No --> H[Skip Site + Save Reason]
    G -- Yes --> I[URL Frontier]

    I --> J[Rate Limit Manager]
    J --> K[Page Fetch Orchestrator]

    K --> L1[HTTP HTML Fetcher]
    K --> L2[Rendered DOM Fetcher: Playwright]
    K --> L3[Network/API Detector]
    K --> L4[Embedded JSON Extractor]
    K --> L5[Structured Data Extractor]
    K --> L6[File Downloader + Parser]
    K --> L7[RSS/Sitemap Parser]

    L1 --> M[Page Classifier]
    L2 --> M
    L3 --> M
    L4 --> M
    L5 --> M
    L6 --> M
    L7 --> M

    M --> N[Universal Content Normalizer]
    N --> O[Dynamic Field Discovery]
    O --> P[Rule-based Extractor]
    P --> Q{Enough Confidence?}

    Q -- Yes --> R[Schema Normalizer]
    Q -- No --> S[AI Extraction Layer]
    S --> R

    R --> T[Validation + Cleaning]
    T --> U[Deduplication]
    U --> V[(MongoDB)]

    V --> W[Export: JSON/CSV/Excel/API]

    K --> X[Failure Handler]
    X --> Y[Retry Queue]
    Y --> J

    H --> Z[Logs + Metrics]
    X --> Z
    V --> Z